(LAB-AYUSH-904 | DERMATOLOGICAL ASSAY CERTIFICATE) Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (SECTION 2: ASSAY METHODOLOGY & STUDY POPULATION) Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2.1 Study Methodology) Tj
T* (Standardized ISO 10993-10 dermatological patch evaluation with repeat insult occlusive) Tj
T* (patch application on healthy human subjects \(N=85\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2.2 Test Procedure) Tj
T* (- Occlusive Finn Chambers applied to infrascapular dorsal skin for 48 hours.) Tj
T* (- Evaluation of erythema and edema at 30 minutes, 24 hours, and 48 hours post-removal.) Tj
T* (- Extended 7-day topical soothing bio-assay on SLS-induced irritated skin sites.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Page 2 of 4) Tj
